# Library Module Rules
- All exports must have explicit return types.
- Pure functions where possible. No side effects except in storage.ts.
- ConversationProvider interface is the most critical abstraction. Never bypass it.
- Persona prompts are template functions: (config: ConversationConfig) => string
- Feedback prompt includes full scoring rubric verbatim. Never abbreviate.
- Storage functions: createSession, getSession, saveFeedback, getFeedback, checkRateLimit.
- Use null for intentional absence. undefined only for optional properties.
